### ===================================================================
### Developer Interview Revision API - HTTP Client Examples
### ===================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@authToken = {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ===================================================================
### AUTHENTICATION
### ===================================================================

### Register New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex User",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "UserPassword123!"
}

### #name loginUser
### Login Test User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "UserPassword123!"
}

### #name loginAdmin
### Login Admin User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "AdminPassword123!"
}

### Get Current User Profile (Requires Auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Update User Preferences
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "selectedPreparationLevel": "intermediate"
}

### ===================================================================
### METADATA: Technologies, Topics, Preparation Levels
### ===================================================================

### Get All Active Technologies
GET {{baseUrl}}/technologies

### Filter Technologies by Category (frontend | backend | database | devops)
GET {{baseUrl}}/technologies?category=frontend

### Get Technology by Slug or ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/technologies/react

### Get All Topics
GET {{baseUrl}}/topics

### Get Topics for Specific Technology
GET {{baseUrl}}/topics?technology=react

### Get Topic by Slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/topics/hooks

### Get All Preparation Levels
GET {{baseUrl}}/preparation-levels

### ===================================================================
### QUESTIONS REVISION & BROWSING
### ===================================================================

### List Published Questions (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Filter Questions by Technology and Level
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?technology=react&level=intermediate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Filter by Topic and Question Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?technology=react&topic=hooks&questionType=Comparison
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Filter by Important Questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?technology=javascript&isImportant=true
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Single Question by ID (Enriched with user's progress if authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/{{sampleQuestionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ===================================================================
### USER PROGRESS & BOOKMARKING
### ===================================================================

### Mark Question as Weak
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{sampleQuestionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "weak"
}

### Mark Question as Known
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{sampleQuestionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "known"
}

### Mark Question for Review
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{sampleQuestionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "review"
}

### Save / Bookmark Question
POST {{baseUrl}}/questions/{{sampleQuestionId}}/save
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Unsave Question
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/questions/{{sampleQuestionId}}/save
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get All Saved Questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/saved?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Reset Question Progress
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{sampleQuestionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ===================================================================
### REVISION SUITE
### ===================================================================

### 1. Revise Weak Questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/revision/weak?technology=react&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. Quick Revision (Deterministic 40% Weak, 30% Review, 20% Important, 10% Unpracticed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/revision/quick?technology=react&preparationLevel=intermediate&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Rapid "Interview Tomorrow" Prep (Prioritized: Weak -> Review -> Important -> Unpracticed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/revision/interview-prep?technologies=react,nodejs,mongodb&preparationLevel=intermediate&limit=15
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ===================================================================
### SEARCH
### ===================================================================

### Full-Text Search across Questions, Answers, Explanations, and Tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=closure
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Search with Technology Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=useref&technology=react
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ===================================================================
### DASHBOARD ANALYTICS
### ===================================================================

### Get User Revision Dashboard Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ===================================================================
### ADMIN CONTENT MANAGEMENT & BULK IMPORT
### ===================================================================

### Create New Technology (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/technologies
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "GraphQL",
  "description": "Query language for APIs and runtime for fulfilling queries",
  "category": "backend",
  "order": 22
}

### Create New Topic (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "technologyId": "{{techId}}",
  "name": "Resolvers and Schema",
  "description": "GraphQL type definitions and field resolvers"
}

### Publish / Archive Question (Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions/{{sampleQuestionId}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions/{{sampleQuestionId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Bulk Import Questions (Admin)
### Supports name-to-ID resolution, duplicate prevention, and flexible schema
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions/import
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questions": [
    {
      "technology": "React",
      "topic": "Hooks",
      "preparationLevels": ["Junior", "Intermediate"],
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "questionType": "Conceptual",
      "question": "What is the purpose of useCallback in React?",
      "answer": "useCallback returns a memoized version of the callback that only changes if one of the dependencies has changed, preventing unnecessary child re-renders.",
      "importantPoints": [
        "Useful when passing callbacks to optimized child components relying on reference equality (React.memo)",
        "Overusing useCallback introduces overhead; do not wrap every function blindly"
      ],
      "codeExamples": [
        {
          "language": "javascript",
          "title": "useCallback example",
          "code": "const memoizedCallback = useCallback(() => { doSomething(a, b); }, [a, b]);"
        }
      ],
      "interviewAnswer": "I use useCallback to preserve function reference identity between renders, primarily when passing callbacks to child components wrapped in React.memo or inside dependency arrays of useEffect.",
      "interviewTips": [
        "Explain that useCallback caches function instances while useMemo caches calculation results."
      ],
      "tags": ["react", "hooks", "usecallback", "performance"],
      "isImportant": true,
      "source": "ai-generated",
      "status": "published"
    }
  ]
}

### Dry-Run Import Preview (Admin)
### Validates and tests duplicates without writing to MongoDB
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions/import/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questions": [
    {
      "technology": "Docker",
      "topic": "Containers",
      "preparationLevels": ["Intermediate"],
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "questionType": "Practical",
      "question": "What is the difference between an image and a container in Docker?",
      "answer": "An image is an immutable template; a container is a running instance.",
      "source": "ai-generated",
      "status": "published"
    },
    {
      "technology": "React",
      "topic": "Hooks",
      "question": "what is useMemo in React?",
      "answer": "Duplicate question test"
    }
  ]
}

### Admin Question Review (List Drafts)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions?status=draft
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin Question Review (Filter by Source)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions?source=ai-generated&status=all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Content Statistics (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/content/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Content Gap Analysis (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/content/gaps
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
